    /// resource health comes from inventory and resource heartbeat data.
    ///
    /// Known values: `pending`, `preflights-failed`, `initial-setup`, `initial-setup-failed`, `provisioning`, `waiting-for-machines`, `waiting-for-secrets`, `provisioning-failed`, `running`, `refresh-failed`, `update-pending`, `updating`, `update-failed`, `delete-pending`, `deleting`, `delete-failed`, `teardown-required`, `teardown-failed`, `retention-required`, `retained`, `deleted`, `error`. Others may appear.
    status: string,
